id: architecture.event_driven
category: architecture
status: verified
date: ''
content: Tektos uses an event-driven architecture for inter-subsystem communication.
  The event bus decouples producers from consumers.
notes: Events flow through the nervous system panel. Subscribers react without tight
  coupling.
